    "that reads `label,value,limit` lines from your own data file and returns a list of\n",
    "`Record` objects. Process the whole list, and keep a running count of how many\n",
    "were `OVER LIMIT`, printed once at the end.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Rules\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Every method does one job**, with a one-line docstring.\n",
    "- Attributes are set through `self` in `__init__` — nothing stored as a plain\n",
    "  local variable that disappears when `__init__` ends.\n",
